{"title":"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/8/8980ffecc8946bf0c3d51fc2f0305849c2e6d1ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^4 \\cdot 9^4 \\cdot 4^9 \\cdot 9^9=$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"124\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/f/8df4aeee6f4ec3908cfc84d67b9cb0332b8a533e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 13^{13} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 13^{36} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 36^{13} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 36^{36} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1296^{26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"481\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/6/fb69b9dc0c9499b84b07646f752484c237a6a067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^x\\times a^y=a^{x+y}$\" width=\"116\" height=\"14\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65f4b2d634a62debdb5ca984b02a0201becdbfc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^4\\cdot 4^9=4^{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"92\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/5/1457b83d48425f91190dc84455ef959599b4231a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9^4\\cdot 9^9=9^{13}$\" width=\"92\" height=\"15\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bf7d048a643778325a65ceacfb001f9e46d3cd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{13}\\cdot 9^{13}=(4\\cdot 9)^{13}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 36^{13}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"245\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p><p>--Solution by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=200685\">TheMaskedMagician</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME\" title=\"1994 AHSME\">1994 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"19